stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> UnderReview
    UnderReview --> Approved
    UnderReview --> Rejected
    Approved --> Active
    Active --> ReviewDue
    ReviewDue --> Active: Revalidated
    ReviewDue --> Deprecated: No longer preferred
    Active --> Superseded: Replaced
    Active --> Expired: Time-bound source ends
    Deprecated --> Archived
    Superseded --> Archived
    Rejected --> Archived
    Expired --> Archived
    Archived --> [*]
